{"id":"n62725-1-14","stage":5,"title":"생필품 · 生活必需品","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62725-1-14-1","ko":"너 아르바이트를 두 개나 한다면서? 돈도 많이 벌겠다.","zh":"你不是说同时做两份兼职吗？应该能赚很多钱吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아르바이트를","meaning":"打工","explanation":"아르바이트：打工；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아르바이트","audio":"/audio/fe901ac998302ac9cf89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24506","senseId":"1","lemma":"아르바이트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개나","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한다면서?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈도","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌겠다.","meaning":"赚，挣","explanation":"벌다：赚，挣；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"벌다","audio":"/audio/0c2e9654aebad7fa3ddc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59096","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"fe901ac998302ac9","term":"아르바이트","zh":"打工","audio":"/audio/fe901ac998302ac9cf89.mp3","entryId":"24506","definition":"为赚钱而在自己的主业以外临时做的事。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dfedd225bb659d50","term":"두","zh":"两","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3","entryId":"71458","definition":"两个的。","pronunciation":["두ː"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","definition":"计算单个东西的计量单位。","pronunciation":["개"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"0c2e9654aebad7fa","term":"벌다","zh":"赚，挣","audio":"/audio/0c2e9654aebad7fa3ddc.mp3","entryId":"59096","definition":"通过工作获得或攒下钱财。","pronunciation":["벌ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f98716521195a1c4e73.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62725-1-14-2","ko":"많이는 무슨. 기본적인 생필품을 사는 것조차 빠듯해.","zh":"哪有那么多。连最基本的日用品都买得紧巴巴的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"많이는","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨.","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기본적인","meaning":"基本的","explanation":"기본적：基本的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"기본적","audio":"/audio/a969d1e53fa3d89bb3b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32507","senseId":"1","lemma":"기본적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생필품을","meaning":"生活必需品","explanation":"생필품：生活必需品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생필품","audio":"/audio/8dc38b8343589cd4d94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62725","senseId":"1","lemma":"생필품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사는","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것조차","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；조차：表示“连……都、甚至……也”，常用于不利的情况。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠듯해.","meaning":"紧张，紧巴巴","explanation":"빠듯하다：紧张，紧巴巴；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빠듯하다","audio":"/audio/4d094a902f14ff6da7fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60808","senseId":"2","lemma":"빠듯하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"a969d1e53fa3d89b","term":"기본적","zh":"基本的","audio":"/audio/a969d1e53fa3d89bb3b6.mp3","entryId":"32507","definition":"成为根本或基础。","pronunciation":["기본적"]},{"id":"8dc38b8343589cd4","term":"생필품","zh":"生活必需品","audio":"/audio/8dc38b8343589cd4d94c.mp3","entryId":"62725","definition":"日常生活中一定需要的东西。","pronunciation":["생필품"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"4d094a902f14ff6d","term":"빠듯하다","zh":"紧张，紧巴巴","audio":"/audio/4d094a902f14ff6da7fb.mp3","entryId":"60808","definition":"勉强能达到某个程度。","pronunciation":["빠드타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f8896ad75fe1c99cb91.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.353,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62725","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你不是说同时做两份兼职吗？应该能赚很多钱吧？","哪有那么多。连最基本的日用品都买得紧巴巴的。","现在这些事情都得你自己想办法处理了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你不是说同时做两份兼职吗？应该能赚很多钱吧？","哪有那么多。连最基本的日用品都买得紧巴巴的。","现在这些事情都得你自己想办法处理了。"],"answer":1}]}
